<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:gx="http://www.google.com/kml/ext/2.2" xmlns:kml="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom">
<Document>
	<name>coast2020.kml</name>
	<description><![CDATA[
Newborough Warren seaward edge (dune edge), digitised by Martin Hollingham in
Google Earth Pro 7.3.7.1155 from imagery dated 2020-04-24.

Named for the IMAGERY date, not the digitising date. Supplied as "coast 2021.kml"
and renamed 2026-08-28 once the imagery date was confirmed: an epoch used in a
retreat rate has to be the date of the imagery it was traced from.

Comparable with coast2006.kml (imagery 2006-01-01) and with the id=2 dune-edge
line of coast1899.kml - all three are dune edges. See data/geo/GEO_PROVENANCE.md.
]]></description>
